			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement tier-gating system and native file watcher\n\nAdd compile-time tier selection system (Plan A §Rust feature flags) with runtime banner:\n- New Cargo.toml features for experimental tiers (SharedMemory, Hyper, Ring, Layer4, Native, etc.)\n- build.rs propagates .env.Land settings to env!(\"Tier…\") compile-time constants\n- LandFixTier logs resolved tiers at boot for diagnostics\n- EmitTierDefaults ensures env!() resolves even without .env.Land\n\nAdd native file watcher (TierFileWatcherLayer4):\n- FileWatcherProvider backed by notify crate (FSEvents/inotify/ReadDirectoryChangesW)\n- Debouncing, glob→regex pattern filtering\n- IPC forwarding to Cocoon as $fileWatcher:event notifications\n- Integrated into CreateEffectForRequest (FileWatcher.Register/Unregister)\n\nAdd workspace folder runtime management:\n- WorkspaceFolderCommand Tauri commands (MountainWorkspaceOpenFolder, List, CloseAll)\n- CLI parsing via ParseWorkspaceFolders (--folder flags, positional dirs, LAND_WORKSPACE_FOLDER env)\n- Boot seeding in Entry::Fn before extension activation\n\nComplete previously-stubbed IPC handlers:\n- Terminal.Resize (uses PTY master handle from TerminalStateDTO)\n- Clipboard.Read/Write (arboard crate, async via spawn_blocking)\n- NativeHost.OpenExternal (open crate with scheme validation)\n- Webview operations (forwarded as sky://webview/* Tauri events)\n- Tree operations (register/unregister)\n- Task.Fetch/Execute (forwarded to ExtHostTaskService)\n- Authentication.GetSession/GetAccounts (forwarded to ExtHostAuthentication)\n- Languages.GetAll (walks scanned extensions for contributes.languages)\n- Debug.Stop (implemented in DebugProvider)\n- showOpenDialog (implemented in NativeHost with tauri-plugin-dialog)\n\nAdd DevLog file sink:\n- Logs to ~/Library/Application Support/<bundle>/logs/<timestamp>/Mountain.dev.log\n- Enabled via LAND_DEV_LOG_FILE=1 or auto-enabled in debug builds\n- Mirrors every dev_log! line with flush-per-line for tail -f\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: TierFileWatcher=Layer4 now requires TierFileWatcherLayer4 feature",
